OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of Jagtar Singh Johal say
OL,4,AScot detained in India has been granted
OL,5,Abail
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a Scottish Sikh activist
OL,8,Fwho has been locked up in India for
OL,9,Falmost nine years without conviction
OL,10,Fhave said he has been granted bail.
OL,12,FJagtar Singh Johal, from Dumbarton, was
OL,13,Farrested in 2017 in connection with
OL,14,Falleged terror offences.
OL,16,FHe was arrested for his alleged role in
OL,17,Fa series of targeted killings of
OL,18,Freligious and political figures.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
