OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of Jagtar Singh Johal say
OL,4,AScot detained in India has been granted
OL,5,Abail
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis family said they were still waiting
OL,8,Ffor the details of what will happen
OL,9,Fnext but are "relieved" by the Indian
OL,10,Fcourt's decision.
